                "title": "Brushed Stainless Steel Loft Handleset",
                "description": "The Brushed Stainless Steel Loft Handleset is made out of stainless steel with a brushed (satin) finish. This modern front door lock is 10-9/16 inches long and 2-3/8 inches wide. The Contemporary Stainless Steel Loft Entryset is available in dummy and single cylinder functions.\r\n",
